This product ports the corrector of VLA-Corrector from https://github.com/ZJU-OmniAI/vla-corrector
(commit 927a06da8f00d7df483459e9039219e076c846de, Apache-2.0, Copyright the ZJU-OmniAI authors).
The ported parts, rewritten in src/lerobot_policy_vla_corrector/corrector.py and backends.py:

- the residual latent-dynamics MLP (src/lerobot/safety/siglip_dynamics_mlp.py, SiglipResidualMLP);
- the threshold state machine (src/lerobot/scripts/lerobot_eval_modified_detection.py, robust_threshold_step);
- the k-step monitor loop of the same script (latent history, prediction queue, cosine mismatch,
  action-queue clear on a trigger);
- the online gradient guidance step of src/lerobot/policies/smolvla_modified/modeling_smolvla_modified.py
  (VLAFlowMatchingModified.sample_actions);
- the cosine and MSE training losses of src/siglip_dynamics/train.py.

Nothing from upstream's modified copy of LeRobot is vendored; base policies are imported from lerobot 0.7.0.

VLA-Corrector is described in arXiv:2607.01804, "VLA-Corrector: Lightweight Detect-and-Correct Inference for
Adaptive Vision-Language-Action Models".
